"OR" are handled with array in `where`, so you can do: 
```ts
await repository.find(
  where: [{
    firstName: Like('%Mike%'),
    lastName: Like('%Mike%'),
  }, 
  {
    firstName: In('King','Kong')
    lastName: In('King','Kong')
  }
],
})
```
